%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 84bc8b7b4e1963c4fba94977599534a1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Ending-Negative
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneData
  fadeIn: 1
  canSkipEntireCutscene: 1
  clips:
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 3
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Chime
      NPCGender: 1
      text: Echo!
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 3
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Echo
      NPCGender: 1
      text: ...Chime.
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 6
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Chime
      NPCGender: 1
      text: Are you okay?! You were corrupted, I had to fight this awful version
        of you.
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 3
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Echo
      NPCGender: 1
      text: Everything came back to me. All of the time we spent together...you pulled
        me in here, and a byproduct of that was giving me amnesia, right?
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 3
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Chime
      NPCGender: 1
      text: ...It's one of the reasons, yes. I'm so sorry, Echo. I didn't want you
        to find out this way.
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 9
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Echo
      NPCGender: 1
      text: You should be. All this time, I thought you were here to help me. Should've
        known it was too good to be true.
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 3
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Chime
      NPCGender: 1
      text: What're you saying, Echo...
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 21
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Echo
      NPCGender: 1
      text: It was all part of your plan from the start. You pulled me in here so
        our emotional connection would be the catalyst for you getting your body
        back. Am I wrong? Tell me I'm wrong, Chime.
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 18
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Chime
      NPCGender: 1
      text: ...I did bring you here in hopes that the spiritual energy resonating
        from our memories would return my human form, but that was never my only
        motive!
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 21
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Echo
      NPCGender: 1
      text: You kept who you really were hidden from me this whole time. I didn't
        choose to forget you, to wipe away the tears, the mourning. It must've been
        the effects of your meddling.
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 15
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Chime
      NPCGender: 1
      text: You had forgotten all about me, my death, our time together...I wanted
        you to remember, I didn't want to overwhelm you but I wanted you to see!
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 3
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Echo
      NPCGender: 1
      text: Oh, I see. I see perfectly clear.
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 21
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Echo
      NPCGender: 1
      text: You used me to set in motion the events that would give you a greater
        form. I'm done being your fool, Chime. I think I'll stay here with my new
        friends, and run things around here since you so kindly pulled me into an
        afterlife.
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 15
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Chime
      NPCGender: 1
      text: Echo...I can't believe you. You're terrible. You're not the Echo I remembered,
        the one I thought I was bringing here. Something must've changed you.
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 15
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Echo
      NPCGender: 1
      text: You needed me as a medium to regain some semblance of form, to get your
        body back. That all it was, all it is.
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  - backgroundType: 2
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    solidColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    duration: 15
    autoContinue: 0
    canSkipClipEarly: 0
    dialogueLine:
      Speaker: Chime
      NPCGender: 1
      text: I sought to embrace you again, to move on to the next place with you.
        If you don't trust me, there's nothing I can do. Goodbye, Echo...
    clipSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 1
  backgroundMusic: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 619550a60a9780d418717bd7f4202e00, type: 3}
  musicVolume: 1
  onCutsceneCompleted:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
